# Where the API is.
#
# UNSET, and the app runs entirely on mock.ts: no database, no server, every
# screen works. That is the mode design review and the browser build use, and
# it is a deliverable in docs/00-PLAN.md rather than a fallback.
#
# RELATIVE ("/v1"): the API lives wherever the page came from. This is what the
# LAN host uses (tools/lan-host/), and it is the right choice for any web build
# served to other devices, because no IP address ends up in the bundle.
#
# ABSOLUTE: needed for a native build, which has no page to be relative to.
# Use the machine's LAN address rather than localhost — on a phone, localhost
# is the phone.
#
# Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* at build time, so changing this needs a rebuild.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL="/v1"
